      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=202s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "it feels like you're doing a lot of work but you're doing the same work and you're spending tokens twice.",
