      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=426s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "This is like arguably should not even be on this slide cuz it's not our human work anymore. It's done by the agent.",
      "timestamp_sec": 462,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=462s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The skill now is what gear am I in? Am I using the appropriate tools for the gear that I'm what I'm trying to accomplish right now.",
