      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=565s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "The problem with chats is that they are the relic of building for implementation. So they're they're default isolated and ephemeral and and brain off.",
      "timestamp_sec": 603,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=603s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Our work now is figure out what decisions matter and then make those decisions and then get out of the way while the agents fill in the rest.",
      "timestamp_sec": 653,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=653s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "If you were If you think back to being a manager or a lead on a team before AI, if your team was having struggling with alignment, you would not tell them like, \"Let's go all work in Slack DMs.\"",
      "timestamp_sec": 692,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=692s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "Plan mode is great, but it's largely a a rich chat message where the agent is saying, \"Hey, here's a like better visualization of what I'm trying to express to you.\"",
      "timestamp_sec": 729,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=729s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "What you want is to separate the the agent as the action and the doc as the state.",
      "timestamp_sec": 801,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=801s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "You're ultimately doing context engineering in this doc, so that every agent is largely stateless and starts from this place um the same place.",
      "timestamp_sec": 801,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=801s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "the first thing we see happen actually is that people start to plan and then not implement their plan. Uh and this is actually like a really good sign.",
      "timestamp_sec": 848,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=848s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "One way I like to frame this is that you're you're shifting from code velocity to idea velocity.",
      "timestamp_sec": 884,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
      "deep_link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kz4QJmNrVXU&t=884s",
      "speaker_attributed": true
    },
    {
      "quote": "the code review is easier because the hardest part of any code review is, you know, what actually matters here.",
      "timestamp_sec": 958,
      "talk_slug": "velocity-sickness-what-happens-when-your-whole-team-gets-10x-faster",
